      ],
      "source": "https://www.villageofwestbaraboo.com/about_us.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lyons was served by a wood schoolhouse until a permanent brick building was constructed in 1901.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
